    {
      "text": "证明：若 $a,b$ 满足 $a>0,b>0,a+b=1$，则 $\\lambda_2=a-b$ 满足 $-1<\\lambda_2<1$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "不等式证明",
        "特征值范围"
      ],
      "question_type": "不等式证明",
      "method": [
        "代数不等式变形"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "用 a+b=1 消元",
        "证明不等式两端"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "eigenvalue_bound_proof",
        "template": "a+b=1,a,b>0 \\Rightarrow -1<a-b<1",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "证明",
          "steps": [
            "由 $b=1-a$，得 $a-b=a-(1-a)=2a-1$。",
            "因 $a>0$ 且 $b=1-a>0\\Rightarrow a<1$，所以 $0<a<1$。",
            "代入 $2a-1$：当 $a\\to0^+$，$2a-1\\to-1$；当 $a\\to1^-$，$2a-1\\to1$，故 $-1<2a-1<1$，即 $-1<a-b<1$，证毕。"
          ]
        }
      ],
